==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Jackie Peng]]s (100%) spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 60~80 seconds<sup>1,800f~2,400f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Sir Seal]]s spawn after 54 seconds<sup>1,620f</sup>, delay 54~108 seconds<sup>1,620f~3,240f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Croco]]s spawn, delay 10~20 seconds<sup>300f~600f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Those Guys]] spawn after 2 seconds<sup>60f</sup>, delay 6~12 seconds<sup>180f~360f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 95% HP:
**10 [[Jackie Peng]]s (150%) spawn, delay 2~4 seconds<sup>60f~120f</sup>.

==Strategy==
A very easy stage that any unit can beat. Bring any of the [[:Category:Normal Cats|Normal Cats]] to win.

==Trivia==
*Like all [[Never Summer! (Monthly Event)|Never Summer!]] stages, Summer Already?'s Japanese name references a song. In this case, Mō Natsuyasumi is a reference to "[https://youtu.be/fRm-oTQOM_w Ah, Natsuyasumi]" by [[wikipedia:Tube (band)|Tube]].

